{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e911d6006945d280b49e","chatId":"05038aaac2ae4ded87633170119f1984","sessionId":null,"userId":70045,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":835,"promptTokens":1494,"completionTokens":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:03:29"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.00590875693381869,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e911d6006945d280b49d","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369809197,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:03:29","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e911d6006945d280b49d","chatId":"05038aaac2ae4ded87633170119f1984","sessionId":null,"userId":70045,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n在一个传统节日很重要的小镇上，当地人举办了一个吃派大赛。然而，比赛中的派总是过于甜腻，多数参与者都不太喜欢。即便如此，布莱恩还是参加了比赛。在他咬下第一口的时候，他的脸皱起来了。但他还是很快换上了微笑并感谢了厨师。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，布莱恩最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 感激\nB) 尴尬\nC) 气恼\nD) 反对\nE) 开心\nF) 惊喜\n\n## 问题 2\n布莱恩为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 他对这种味道感到恶心，但又害怕激怒做派的厨师\nB) 他真的很喜欢这个传统节日和节日食物\nC) 布莱恩原本并不想参加，但他的朋友们逼他参加\nD) 他害怕他因为派太甜而无法吃完。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.00590875693381869,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e911d6006945d280b49e","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369809194,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:03:29","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"00c0370e859748bdaad637273e0582e2"}